FIX D2 — knowledge resolver never falls back to GCS
================================================================================

PROBLEM
  agent.py:265-272

      if _KNOWLEDGE_LOCAL_ROOT.is_dir():
          print(f"[KNOUX knowledge] local artifact missing: {file_name}")
          return None, "unavailable:local-missing"
