================================================================================
NOT INCLUDED, AND WHY
================================================================================

D4/D5 — the MCP tool surface.
  tool_filter=["gateway_status"] is doing its job: it is an allowlist of one tool
  because the gateway only publishes one tool. Widening the filter without
  adding gateway tools would just produce an empty or misleading tool list.
  Adding Meta, Google, community and WhatsApp tools to the Cloud Run MCP gateway
  is a separate piece of work with its own review, and it is the prerequisite
  for D9. See docs/growth/CONNECTORS.md.

D8 — provider abstraction in the agent.
  Not needed for this product. Provider replaceability is enforced on the KNOuX
  side by src/lib/growth/intelligence/router.ts, which lets the agent keep its
  GlobalGemini declaration without the Social / Growth product caring. If the
  agent itself ever needs it, patches/knoux-agent-growth.patch introduces
  KnouxBaseModel.

D9 — Growth intelligence families.
  Requires D4/D5 first. See patches/knoux-agent-growth.patch.

